# A regular tetrahedron at the origin — four vertices carrying four faces,
# which is the least a closed surface can share (v/t = 1.0).
#
# Generated geometry, committed so the loader and the mesh benchmarks
# have something with shared vertices to work on.

v 0.577350 0.577350 0.577350
v 0.577350 -0.577350 -0.577350
v -0.577350 0.577350 -0.577350
v -0.577350 -0.577350 0.577350

f 1 2 3
f 1 4 2
f 1 3 4
f 2 4 3
